ath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 26, "prompt": "You hear a trainee nurse receiving feedback from her tutor about the ward round she’s just\ncompleted.\nWhat would have improved the nurse’s performance?\nA eliciting information from the patient\nB keeping the patient better informed\nC updating patient notes more fully", "sourcePage": 109, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 27, "prompt": "You hear a hospital nurse briefing a colleague about a patient with Chronic Obstructive\nPulmonary Disease, or COPD.\nWhat does he want his colleague to do?\nA encourage greater mobility\nB organise a visit by a dietitian\nC consult with the medical team", "sourcePage": 109, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 28, "prompt": "You hear two hospital managers talking about a training session for people who do\nvoluntary work with patients.\nWhat do the managers think about the course?\nA Too few people attended to make it worthwhile.\nB The content may need revising for future sessions.\nC The feedback from participants wasn’t encouraging.", "sourcePage": 110, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 29, "prompt": "You hear a pharmacist talking to a doctor about a patient’s medication.\nWhat is the pharmacist doing?\nA reporting side effects\nB checking the dosage\nC recommending an alternative", "sourcePage": 110, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 30, "prompt": "You hear a surgeon talking to a member of his team as they are finishing a surgical\nprocedure.\nThe surgeon says their next priority should be\nA to complete a routine administrative task.\nB to report a faulty piece of equipment.\nC to locate an appropriate bed.", "sourcePage": 110, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["bc5381030daced1515d88f15ffce92ce55772cff3bbdddbc95d2e367b3fedaa5"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
